- A. cos(θ)/sin(θ) => Q2_WRONG
- B. sin(θ)cos(θ) => Q2_WRONG
- C. 1/cot(θ) => Q2_WRONG
- D. sin(θ)/cos(θ) => Q2_CORRECT

~ Q2_CORRECT
